{"step_index":33,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-12T15:12:39Z","input_tokens":2289,"cache_read_tokens":52075,"output_tokens":3802,"thinking":"Docker daemon appears inactive, despite Docker Desktop installation. The build process can proceed, deferring the runtime dependency check until testing. Potential solutions include starting Docker Desktop via system tools if necessary.\n\n\nCreating the necessary configuration files for Stage 2, starting with `.gitignore` to exclude sensitive data and build artifacts. Following that, an `.env.example` file is constructed with placeholder values for database, cache, object storage, and application environment variables. These values are designed to ensure the application's basic functionality and provide example configurations for setup.\n\n\nConstructing the backend structure, starting with the `Dockerfile` based on `python:3.12-slim`, and installing system dependencies including `ffmpeg` and `curl`. Proceeding to copy and install Python dependencies from `requirements.txt`. Subsequently, the application code, database migration files, and entrypoint script are copied into the container image.\n\n\nDefining dependencies for the backend, focusing on version compatibility for core libraries, database drivers, and testing tools. The entrypoint script will execute database migrations before running the application. Core application configuration involves environment variable loading and database connection management with Redis integration.\n\n\nDefining health check endpoints and services to ensure application and dependency availability. Constructed health-check router for API v1, integrating checks for database, Redis, and object storage connections. Implementing FastAPI app with lifespan management to handle Redis connection initialization and disposal, alongside the defined API v1 health endpoint. Also, created a minimal worker for background tasks and an entry for Redis health checks.\n\n\nHealth checks will verify the Redis connection by checking for the `arq` process. A basic static HTML file will serve as a frontend placeholder.\n\nNginx configuration includes upload size limits and request buffering for video streaming. It proxies API requests to the backend, documentation requests, and an internal S3 endpoint for the MinIO service, along with serving the static SPA.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"# Environment\n.env\n.env.local\n\n# Python\n__pycache__/\n*.py[cod]\n*$py.class\n.venv/\nvenv/\n.pytest_cache/\n.mypy_cache/\n.ruff_cache/\n*.egg-info/\n\n# Frontend\nfrontend/node_modules/\nfrontend/dist/\n!frontend/dist/.gitkeep\n\n# Logs & temp\n*.log\ntmp/\n.DS_Store\nThumbs.db\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\.gitignore"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"# === Application ===\nAPP_NAME=YouTube Clone MVP\nAPP_ENV=development\nAPP_PORT=80\nCORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost,http://127.0.0.1\n\n# === Security / JWT ===\nSECRET_KEY=change-this-to-a-long-random-secret-key-in-production-min-32-chars\nJWT_ALGORITHM=HS256\nACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=15\nREFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7\nCOOKIE_SECURE=false\n\n# === PostgreSQL 16 ===\nPOSTGRES_USER=youtube\nPOSTGRES_PASSWORD=youtube_secret_password\nPOSTGRES_DB=youtube\nPOSTGRES_HOST=postgres\nPOSTGRES_PORT=5432\nDATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://youtube:youtube_secret_password@postgres:5432/youtube\n\n# === Redis 7 ===\nREDIS_HOST=redis\nREDIS_PORT=6379\nREDIS_URL=redis://redis:6379/0\n\n# === MinIO (S3) ===\nMINIO_ROOT_USER=minioadmin\nMINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=minioadmin_secret\nMINIO_ENDPOINT=http://minio:9000\nMINIO_REGION=us-east-1\nMINIO_VIDEOS_BUCKET=videos\nMINIO_THUMBNAILS_BUCKET=thumbnails\n\n# === Upload Limits ===\nMAX_VIDEO_SIZE_MB=1024\nMAX_THUMBNAIL_SIZE_MB=10\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\.env.example"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"worker_processes auto;\n\nevents {\n    worker_connections 1024;\n}\n\nhttp {\n    include /etc/nginx/mime.types;\n    default_type application/octet-stream;\n\n    sendfile on;\n    tcp_nopush on;\n    tcp_nodelay on;\n    keepalive_timeout 65;\n\n    # Allow large video uploads\n    client_max_body_size 2G;\n\n    upstream backend_upstream {\n        server backend:8000;\n    }\n\n    upstream minio_upstream {\n        server minio:9000;\n    }\n\n    server {\n        listen 80;\n        server_name _;\n\n        # Streaming upload endpoint: disable request buffering so files stream directly\n        location /api/v1/videos/upload {\n            proxy_pass http://backend_upstream;\n            proxy_request_buffering off;\n            proxy_http_version 1.1;\n            proxy_set_header Host $host;\n            proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n            proxy_read_timeout 600s;\n            proxy_send_timeout 600s;\n        }\n\n        # Backend API\n        location /api/ {\n            proxy_pass http://backend_upstream;\n            proxy_http_version 1.1;\n            proxy_set_header Host $host;\n            proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n        }\n\n        # Swagger / OpenAPI docs\n        location ~ ^/(docs|redoc|openapi\\.json) {\n            proxy_pass http://backend_upstream;\n            proxy_http_version 1.1;\n            proxy_set_header Host $host;\n            proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;\n            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;\n            proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;\n        }\n\n        # Internal S3 proxy for X-Accel-Redirect video/thumbnail streaming with Range support\n        location /_internal_s3/ {\n            internal;\n            rewrite ^/_internal_s3/(.*)$ /$1 break;\n            proxy_pass http://minio_upstream;\n            proxy_http_version 1.1;\n            proxy_set_header Host minio:9000;\n            proxy_set_header Range $http_range;\n            proxy_set_header If-Range $http_if_range;\n            proxy_buffering off;\n            proxy_request_buffering off;\n            proxy_intercept_errors on;\n        }\n\n        # SPA static files\n        location / {\n            root /usr/share/nginx/html;\n            index index.html;\n            try_files $uri $uri/ /index.html;\n        }\n    }\n}\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\nginx\\nginx.conf"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ru\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n    <title>YouTube Clone MVP</title>\n    <style>\n      body { font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif; background: #0f0f0f; color: #f1f1f1; display: grid; place-items: center; min-height: 100vh; margin: 0; }\n      .card { text-align: center; padding: 2rem; border: 1px solid #272727; border-radius: 12px; background: #181818; }\n      a { color: #3ea6ff; text-decoration: none; }\n    </style>\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h1>YouTube Clone MVP</h1>\n      <p>Инфраструктура запущена. Фронтенд будет собран на Этапе 6.</p>\n      <p><a href=\"/docs\">Swagger API (/docs)</a> · <a href=\"/api/v1/health\">Health Check</a></p>\n    </div>\n  </body>\n</html>\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\frontend\\dist\\index.html"}}]}
