{"step_index":62,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-12T15:14:10Z","input_tokens":2830,"cache_read_tokens":62526,"output_tokens":3250,"thinking":"I'm thinking through how to approach this.\n\n\nInitial setup involves configuring database and cache connections using environment variables and ensuring appropriate health checks within the Docker Compose file for Postgres, Redis, and MinIO services. MinIO's health check presents a possible challenge due to potential variations in included utilities (`curl` vs. `mc` or other alternatives). Confirming availability of `curl` or adapting the health check to leverage `mc` or other strategies for reliable service validation.\n\n\nThe Docker Compose configuration details service dependencies and health checks. The `minio-init` service initializes storage buckets, depending on the healthy status of the MinIO service. The `backend` service builds the application with migrations enabled, dependent on healthy database, cache, and initialization services and includes an API health check. The `worker` service also builds the application, but without migrations, and verifies process health directly within the Python environment, leveraging Python's built-in modules for portablility. Finally, the `nginx` service configuration uses an Alpine-based image.\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"from contextlib import asynccontextmanager\n\nfrom fastapi import FastAPI\nfrom fastapi.middleware.cors import CORSMiddleware\n\nfrom app.api.v1.routers import health as health_router\nfrom app.core.config import settings\nfrom app.core.database import engine\nfrom app.core.redis import close_redis_client, get_redis_client\n\n\n@asynccontextmanager\nasync def lifespan(_: FastAPI):\n    \"\"\"Initialize and gracefully close shared infrastructure connections.\"\"\"\n    get_redis_client()\n    yield\n    await close_redis_client()\n    await engine.dispose()\n\n\napp = FastAPI(\n    title=settings.APP_NAME,\n    version=\"0.1.0\",\n    description=(\n        \"REST API видеохостинга (YouTube Clone MVP). \"\n        \"Слоистая архитектура, потоковая загрузка в MinIO, HTTP Range-стриминг и фоновая обработка FFmpeg.\"\n    ),\n    docs_url=\"/docs\",\n    redoc_url=\"/redoc\",\n    openapi_url=\"/openapi.json\",\n    lifespan=lifespan,\n)\n\napp.add_middleware(\n    CORSMiddleware,\n    allow_origins=settings.cors_origins_list,\n    allow_credentials=True,\n    allow_methods=[\"*\"],\n    allow_headers=[\"*\"],\n)\n\napp.include_router(health_router.router, prefix=\"/api/v1\")\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\backend\\app\\main.py"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"from arq.connections import RedisSettings\n\nfrom app.core.config import settings\n\n\nasync def ping_worker(ctx: dict) -> str:\n    \"\"\"Placeholder background task verifying Arq worker execution.\"\"\"\n    return \"pong\"\n\n\nclass WorkerSettings:\n    \"\"\"Arq worker configuration for background video processing.\"\"\"\n\n    functions = [ping_worker]\n    redis_settings = RedisSettings.from_dsn(settings.REDIS_URL)\n    max_jobs = 4\n    job_timeout = 1800\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\backend\\app\\worker.py"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"services:\n  postgres:\n    image: postgres:16-alpine\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    environment:\n      POSTGRES_USER: ${POSTGRES_USER:-youtube}\n      POSTGRES_PASSWORD: ${POSTGRES_PASSWORD:-youtube_secret_password}\n      POSTGRES_DB: ${POSTGRES_DB:-youtube}\n    volumes:\n      - postgres_data:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"pg_isready -U $${POSTGRES_USER} -d $${POSTGRES_DB}\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 10\n    networks:\n      - youtube_net\n\n  redis:\n    image: redis:7-alpine\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    volumes:\n      - redis_data:/data\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"redis-cli\", \"ping\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 3s\n      retries: 10\n    networks:\n      - youtube_net\n\n  minio:\n    image: minio/minio:latest\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    command: server /data --console-address \":9001\"\n    environment:\n      MINIO_ROOT_USER: ${MINIO_ROOT_USER:-minioadmin}\n      MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD:-minioadmin_secret}\n    volumes:\n      - minio_data:/data\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"curl\", \"-f\", \"http://localhost:9000/minio/health/live\"]\n      interval: 5s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 10\n    networks:\n      - youtube_net\n\n  minio-init:\n    image: minio/mc:latest\n    depends_on:\n      minio:\n        condition: service_healthy\n    environment:\n      MINIO_ROOT_USER: ${MINIO_ROOT_USER:-minioadmin}\n      MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD: ${MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD:-minioadmin_secret}\n      MINIO_VIDEOS_BUCKET: ${MINIO_VIDEOS_BUCKET:-videos}\n      MINIO_THUMBNAILS_BUCKET: ${MINIO_THUMBNAILS_BUCKET:-thumbnails}\n    entrypoint: >\n      /bin/sh -c \"\n      mc alias set local http://minio:9000 $${MINIO_ROOT_USER} $${MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD};\n      mc mb -p local/$${MINIO_VIDEOS_BUCKET};\n      mc mb -p local/$${MINIO_THUMBNAILS_BUCKET};\n      echo 'MinIO buckets initialized successfully.';\n      \"\n    restart: \"no\"\n    networks:\n      - youtube_net\n\n  backend:\n    build:\n      context: ./backend\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    env_file:\n      - .env\n    environment:\n      RUN_MIGRATIONS: \"true\"\n    depends_on:\n      postgres:\n        condition: service_healthy\n      redis:\n        condition: service_healthy\n      minio-init:\n        condition: service_completed_successfully\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD\", \"curl\", \"-f\", \"http://localhost:8000/api/v1/health\"]\n      interval: 10s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 10\n      start_period: 15s\n    networks:\n      - youtube_net\n\n  worker:\n    build:\n      context: ./backend\n      dockerfile: Dockerfile\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    env_file:\n      - .env\n    environment:\n      RUN_MIGRATIONS: \"false\"\n    command: [\"arq\", \"app.worker.WorkerSettings\"]\n    depends_on:\n      postgres:\n        condition: service_healthy\n      redis:\n        condition: service_healthy\n      minio-init:\n        condition: service_completed_successfully\n    healthcheck:\n      test:\n        [\n          \"CMD-SHELL\",\n          \"python -c \\\"import glob; assert any('arq' in open(p, 'rb').read().decode('utf-8', 'ignore') for p in glob.glob('/proc/[0-9]*/cmdline'))\\\"\",\n        ]\n      interval: 10s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 5\n      start_period: 10s\n    networks:\n      - youtube_net\n\n  nginx:\n    image: nginx:1.27-alpine\n    restart: unless-stopped\n    ports:\n      - \"${APP_PORT:-80}:80\"\n    volumes:\n      - ./nginx/nginx.conf:/etc/nginx/nginx.conf:ro\n      - ./frontend/dist:/usr/share/nginx/html:ro\n    depends_on:\n      backend:\n        condition: service_healthy\n    healthcheck:\n      test: [\"CMD-SHELL\", \"wget -qO- http://127.0.0.1/api/v1/health >/dev/null 2>&1 || exit 1\"]\n      interval: 10s\n      timeout: 5s\n      retries: 5\n    networks:\n      - youtube_net\n\nvolumes:\n  postgres_data:\n  redis_data:\n  minio_data:\n\nnetworks:\n  youtube_net:\n    driver: bridge\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\docker-compose.yml"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":".PHONY: up down build ps logs health migrate test\n\nup:\n\t./deploy.sh\n\ndown:\n\tdocker compose down\n\nbuild:\n\tdocker compose build\n\nps:\n\tdocker compose ps\n\nlogs:\n\tdocker compose logs -f --tail=100\n\nhealth:\n\tcurl -fsS http://localhost:$${APP_PORT:-80}/api/v1/health && echo \"\"\n\nmigrate:\n\tdocker compose exec backend alembic upgrade head\n\ntest:\n\tdocker compose exec backend pytest -v\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\Makefile"}},{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\nset -euo pipefail\n\nif [ ! -f .env ]; then\n  echo \"[deploy] .env not found, copying from .env.example...\"\n  cp .env.example .env\nfi\n\necho \"[deploy] Building and starting services...\"\ndocker compose up -d --build\n\necho \"[deploy] Waiting for services to become healthy...\"\nfor i in $(seq 1 30); do\n  if docker compose ps --format json | grep -q '\"Health\":\"healthy\"'; then\n    if curl -fsS \"http://localhost:${APP_PORT:-80}/api/v1/health\" >/dev/null 2>&1; then\n      echo \"[deploy] System is healthy!\"\n      echo \"  - App:     http://localhost:${APP_PORT:-80}\"\n      echo \"  - Swagger: http://localhost:${APP_PORT:-80}/docs\"\n      echo \"  - Health:  http://localhost:${APP_PORT:-80}/api/v1/health\"\n      exit 0\n    fi\n  fi\n  sleep 2\ndone\n\necho \"[deploy] Timed out waiting for healthy status. Current containers:\"\ndocker compose ps\nexit 1\n","Overwrite":true,"Path":"c:\\Users\\kiril\\OneDrive\\Рабочий стол\\Лабы\\AQA\\YoutubeTask\\deploy.sh"}}]}
